{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Gah!",
    "steam_appid": 2471090,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471090/extras/cf868d63f04b8e48251698721452ba0a.avif?t=1754656016\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gah! is a blend of hack'n'slash and roguelite. Choose a character, embark on an adventure, and battle monsters. Progress, upgrade your character, find items, and then... perish. But don't worry - no death is in vain; use your acquired resources to upgrade your village and unlock new characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is focused on short adventures (around one hour each), grouped into theme-related chapters. Each adventure offers a unique experience (even when replayed), thanks to procedurally generated levels and a touch of randomness in character development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lots of characters to choose from</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the beginning of the game, you will have access to 3 base characters: King, Sorcerer, and Rogue. However, as you progress, new characters will be unlocked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter allows you to unlock additional 2 playable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471090/extras/1319dd391f2ba78a4de4d2e8113f09da.avif?t=1754656016\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The environment... will change</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start in the dungeon, but soon you'll discover that objects from other worlds are beginning to enter your realm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you advance, you'll encounter enemies wielding unfamiliar weapons. Unlock playable characters who can wield these weapons themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471090/extras/cb3ace6b764a8b22a39874ed0dd1ab42.avif?t=1754656016\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your path</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each level, you'll have the opportunity to choose between two paths with different secondary objectives. Successfully completing them will reward you with additional loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Active skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character possesses 4 unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, every ability (basic, special, and auto-attack) has 4 potential upgrades (with 2 levels), and you can choose 2 upgrades per ability. Here's an example of the King's skill:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471090/extras/70430377487ceda5c10fdcb6c2818432.avif?t=1754656016\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After leveling up, you'll select 1 upgrade from a set of randomly available options. You don't have to juggle skills, you choose your set and upgrade it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Passive skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, there are 3 passive skill trees that you can unlock by collecting orbs from defeated enemies. Each tree contains 4 levels of skills, resulting in 8-10 skills per tree. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red skill tree (one of three):</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471090/extras/87046c1a93e28928e3447bb5b5b2a724.avif?t=1754656016\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The primary mode of Gah! is The Adventure, where you'll embark on a campaign, unlock new NPCs, upgrades, playable characters, and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, each level you complete will be unlocked for the second difficulty - The Nightmare. Completing levels on this difficulty unlocks more stuff for you :). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also different modes that can be unlocked during the Adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471090/extras/cf868d63f04b8e48251698721452ba0a.avif?t=1754656016\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gah! is a blend of hack'n'slash and roguelite. Choose a character, embark on an adventure, and battle monsters. Progress, upgrade your character, find items, and then... perish. But don't worry - no death is in vain; use your acquired resources to upgrade your village and unlock new characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is focused on short adventures (around one hour each), grouped into theme-related chapters. Each adventure offers a unique experience (even when replayed), thanks to procedurally generated levels and a touch of randomness in character development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lots of characters to choose from</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the beginning of the game, you will have access to 3 base characters: King, Sorcerer, and Rogue. However, as you progress, new characters will be unlocked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter allows you to unlock additional 2 playable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471090/extras/1319dd391f2ba78a4de4d2e8113f09da.avif?t=1754656016\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The environment... will change</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start in the dungeon, but soon you'll discover that objects from other worlds are beginning to enter your realm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you advance, you'll encounter enemies wielding unfamiliar weapons. Unlock playable characters who can wield these weapons themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471090/extras/cb3ace6b764a8b22a39874ed0dd1ab42.avif?t=1754656016\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your path</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each level, you'll have the opportunity to choose between two paths with different secondary objectives. Successfully completing them will reward you with additional loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Active skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character possesses 4 unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, every ability (basic, special, and auto-attack) has 4 potential upgrades (with 2 levels), and you can choose 2 upgrades per ability. Here's an example of the King's skill:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471090/extras/70430377487ceda5c10fdcb6c2818432.avif?t=1754656016\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After leveling up, you'll select 1 upgrade from a set of randomly available options. You don't have to juggle skills, you choose your set and upgrade it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Passive skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, there are 3 passive skill trees that you can unlock by collecting orbs from defeated enemies. Each tree contains 4 levels of skills, resulting in 8-10 skills per tree. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red skill tree (one of three):</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471090/extras/87046c1a93e28928e3447bb5b5b2a724.avif?t=1754656016\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The primary mode of Gah! is The Adventure, where you'll embark on a campaign, unlock new NPCs, upgrades, playable characters, and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, each level you complete will be unlocked for the second difficulty - The Nightmare. Completing levels on this difficulty unlocks more stuff for you :). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also different modes that can be unlocked during the Adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun!</p>",
    "short_description": "Fight through procedurally generated levels - from haunted dungeons to futuristic space stations. Choose from 13 unique characters, crush your enemies, gather loot, face deadly bosses, and return to a growing village hub where permanent upgrades await. The demons watch. The angels wait. You fight.",
